Figure 1: Experimental arrangements: (a) DPS-NICA followed by STIKL;
the stopping profile and range in STIKL, together with the intervening
energy losses, determine the energy at the studied DPS-NICA pad;
(b) independent STIKL measurements with and without degraders.
The first-plane signal is analysed, while the sum of planes 2–31 defines
the event selection. The diagrams are not to scale.
